6. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY
MediHub and its affiliates shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages.

7. CONTACT
For questions about these Terms, contact us at support@medihub.lk
''';

  static const String _privacyContent = '''
PRIVACY POLICY

Last Updated: January 2024

1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT
MediHub collects personal health information including your name, email address, medication schedules, appointment records, and daily health check-in data.

2. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION
Your health data is used to display personalized medication reminders, track appointment schedules, and share daily check-in reports with your assigned medical team.

3. DATA SHARING
Health data including daily check-ins and symptom reports is shared with your registered medical team.

